        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "EMAIL ENQUERIES ONLY: Property Partners Moore Larkin are delighted to offer for rental, No. 8 Church Walk, Bastion Court, Athlone. Located on Athlone`s fashionable west side of the river Shannon, Bastion Court is a very popular residential location close to all amenities in a town centre location. Residents also enjoy the benefits of a modern apartment development with secure underground car parking. The subject property consists of a spacious 1 bedroom apartment, measuring approximately 54 sq.m / 580 sq.ft. Located on the first floor, with a sunny west-facing balcony, which is accessed via both the sitting room and also from the large double bedroom.\nViewings come highly recommended."
